{"3645130": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Micro Titans Wrestling", "steam_appid": 3645130, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Micro Titans Wrestling is roguelike deck builder set in the Golden Era of pro wrestling.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645130/extras/4bd31ce0d94a4dff9381fb4a28e1d3e6.avif?t=1788249207\" width=616 height=532 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilise a combination of levelable cards - moves, high spots and wildcards - powerful character traits, synergistic perks, and match-changing managers to elevate your wrestler to a game-breaking warrior!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645130/extras/305f2770e379bf3ce8a9f21be5db7a69.avif?t=1788249207\" width=616 height=442 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as 17 wrestlers, competing for 18 titles, spread across 3 unique game modes; Singles Road to the Title, Tag Team Extravaganza, and Steel Cage Challenge. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete branching title runs of increasing difficulty to unlock additional cards, perks, character skins, and more. Every wrestler has their own strengths. Every run is a unique challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Forever!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645130/extras/41df159617154a060a16689b48206a46.avif?t=1788249207\" width=616 height=323 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 <strong>Unique Game Modes</strong> to battle through</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 <strong>Managers</strong> to fight your corner</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >17 distinct <strong>Wrestlers</strong> to take to the ring</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >18 <strong>Titles</strong> to prove you're the champion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >83 <strong>Wildcards</strong> to rock your opponent</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 <strong>Character Traits</strong> to buff over time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >200 <strong>High Spot Cards</strong> to disrupt the match</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >600 <strong>Perks</strong> to power up your build</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 9,000 <strong>Move Cards</strong> to inflict maximum damage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An infinite amount of <strong>Synergistic Effects</strong></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Micro Titans Wrestling is roguelike deck builder set in the Golden Era of pro wrestling.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645130/extras/4bd31ce0d94a4dff9381fb4a28e1d3e6.avif?t=1788249207\" width=616 height=532 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilise a combination of levelable cards - moves, high spots and wildcards - powerful character traits, synergistic perks, and match-changing managers to elevate your wrestler to a game-breaking warrior!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645130/extras/305f2770e379bf3ce8a9f21be5db7a69.avif?t=1788249207\" width=616 height=442 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as 17 wrestlers, competing for 18 titles, spread across 3 unique game modes; Singles Road to the Title, Tag Team Extravaganza, and Steel Cage Challenge. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete branching title runs of increasing difficulty to unlock additional cards, perks, character skins, and more. Every wrestler has their own strengths. Every run is a unique challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Forever!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645130/extras/41df159617154a060a16689b48206a46.avif?t=1788249207\" width=616 height=323 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 <strong>Unique Game Modes</strong> to battle through</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 <strong>Managers</strong> to fight your corner</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >17 distinct <strong>Wrestlers</strong> to take to the ring</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >18 <strong>Titles</strong> to prove you're the champion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >83 <strong>Wildcards</strong> to rock your opponent</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 <strong>Character Traits</strong> to buff over time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >200 <strong>High Spot Cards</strong> to disrupt the match</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >600 <strong>Perks</strong> to power up your build</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 9,000 <strong>Move Cards</strong> to inflict maximum damage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An infinite amount of <strong>Synergistic Effects</strong></p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Micro Titans Wrestling is a nostalgia fuelled roguelik